Nando Florestan SoundFonts (https://dev.nando.audio/pages/soundfonts.html)
The built-in string and brass assets in `crates/instruments/assets`
(`string_quartet.sf3`, `strings.sf3`, `pizzicato.sf3`, `trumpet.sf3`,
`french_horns.sf3`) are derived from Nando Florestan's 040 String Quartet,
048 Strings, 045 Pizzicato, 056 Trumpet Metallic and 060 French Horns.
These are Public Domain, except **056 Trumpet Metallic**, which requires
attribution to Nando Florestan. Converted from SF2 to SF3 (Ogg Vorbis q0.8).
